JBL Sound System Advertisement Proposal

Introduction
The purpose of this project is to create a website that advertises and promotes a JBL Sound System. The website will give customers information about the product and encourage them to buy it.

Aim of the Website
The main aim is to create a simple website where customers can learn about the JBL Sound System. The website will show pictures, product information, features and the price.

Website Features
* A home page
* Pictures of the JBL Sound System
* Product information
* A list of features
* The price of the product
* An “Add to Cart” or “Buy Now” button
* A contact section
* Navigation buttons

Target Audience
* Students
* Music lovers
* Gamers
* Families
* People who enjoy parties
* People who like good sound

Advertisement
The website will advertise the JBL Sound System using pictures and simple information about the product. The website will show the important features of the sound system and make it easy for customers to understand what they are buying.

